hk-transport (港交寶)
=====================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers this repository's source code.

Bundled data
------------

`src/hk_transport/data/mtr_exits.json` is a snapshot derived from the Lands
Department "Location Search" API and "Coordinates Transformation" API,
published on data.gov.hk.

`src/hk_transport/data/mtr_service_hours.json` is a snapshot derived from the
MTR Corporation's public service-hours pages on mtr.com.hk. It is not a
data.gov.hk dataset and remains subject to the MTR website terms.

Fares, routes, station and facility tables, the TD GTFS headway feed, and the
live MTR feeds are read from data.gov.hk or the operator's endpoint at run
time. They are not redistributed in this repository.

Use of that data is subject to the data.gov.hk terms and conditions:
https://data.gov.hk/tc/terms-and-conditions
